@startuml
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #1F4E79
  LifeLineBorderColor #9DB7D5
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #1F4E79
  ParticipantFontColor #123B5D
  ParticipantFontSize 14
  ActorBackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  ActorBorderColor #1F4E79
  ActorFontColor #123B5D
  ActorFontSize 14
  MessageFontSize 13
}
title 图 3-7 配送失败与退款时序图
autonumber

actor 骑手
participant "骑手 App" as RiderApp
participant "调度服务" as Dispatch
participant "订单服务" as Order
participant "退款服务" as Refund
participant "支付平台" as PSP
participant "商家端" as Merchant
participant "日志服务" as Log

骑手 -> RiderApp : 上报配送异常(原因)
RiderApp -> Dispatch : 提交异常
Dispatch -> Order : 校验订单状态(配送中)
Order --> Dispatch : 允许上报
Dispatch -> Dispatch : 订单状态=配送异常
Dispatch -> Merchant : 通知商家
Dispatch -> Dispatch : 尝试改派一次
alt 改派成功
  Dispatch -> Order : 状态=配送中, 新配送单
  Dispatch --> RiderApp : 新任务
else 改派失败
  Dispatch -> Order : 取消订单
  Order -> Refund : 创建全额退款单
  Refund -> PSP : 原路退款
  PSP --> Refund : 退款成功
  Refund -> Order : 订单状态=已退款
  Dispatch -> Log : 记录异常与退款
  Dispatch --> Merchant : 退款完成通知
end

note right of Order
  配送异常不能长期停留；
  同一异常重复上报只保留一条记录；
  退款失败保持“退款中”并重试。
end note
@enduml
